    "name": "📌 Cerebras API ⚡",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Cerebras powers the world's fastest AI inference on the biggest wafer chip.\"\n\nCerebras runs open models from other labs, such as gpt-oss and Qwen, on its own wafer-scale hardware through an OpenAI-compatible API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Inference hosts**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Cerebras Account: [https://cloud.cerebras.ai/](https://cloud.cerebras.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `cerebras_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:cerebras_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/api-reference/chat-completions](https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/api-reference/chat-completions)\n    \n- Models: [https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/models/overview](https://inference-docs.cerebras.ai/models/overview)",
